Model Output Disclaimer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Zydra is trained from random initialization on a small synthetic corpus.
Outputs are not guaranteed to be accurate, coherent, or safe. This model is
a proof of concept and must not be used in production, safety-critical, or
decision-making contexts without independent evaluation and human oversight.